{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"明确写出“正因为刚才如此快乐，退下来的时候才更清楚地感到自己不愿这段亲近就这样过去”：亲近带来的满足使这段经历变得珍贵，因此满足之后反而生出希望亲近继续的愿望，因果完整。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S03、S04、S11–S12\",\n      \"why\": \"写到了每一刻无法原样留住、时间流逝会引发舍不得和心痛，但没有写清主动试图抓牢当下如何加深自身的情感牵动，以及为什么这种努力无法换来未来继续亲近的保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"why\": \"明确区分了身体松弛与内心状态：“身体先松下来，而他对那个人的在乎仍然很深”。这说明生理上的紧张消退只是激动暂时退去，并不意味着深层的在意、依恋和伤感随之解决。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S05、S14\",\n      \"why\": \"S05写出当下的强烈感受退去后，牵挂仍能独自维持；S14进一步写出回想过去的亲近仍带来亲切感，但那些经历不能原样重来，留下的感情和对那个人的牵动却仍然存在，最终使爱意再次涌起。回味能带来温暖，却不能替代现实中的亲近，因果基本完整。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [\n    \"1处（全稿共用设定，主要见S01–S14）：将整首曲子具体设定为一个人面对眼前的特定对象、并与对方反复经历亲近的情境；音乐可以支持情绪变化的解读，却不能独立证明这个对象真实存在、始终在场，或双方确实发生过这些亲近经历。稿子没有进一步编造可辨认的身份、职业或具体往事。\"\n  ],\n  \"loops\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c92ab650-ec54-4ba0-9a67-7c0402263378", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133454782956Z", "elapsed_seconds": 269.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:39:24.345028+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2c27ea44ad3db84887d6b86750317700c5bd129fe5481711f8c3d4192c0762d1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133454782956Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1e029ab4f87e5e306cfb7ec4fc3091715d7eb4a2cfd166698665ec74f5f5279a"}}}
